  q(TERM,'Which vessels have walls one cell thick, allowing exchange of gases and nutrients?','Capillaries',['Arteries','Veins','Arterioles'],'B','Capillaries connect arterioles and venules; skin punctures collect a mix of capillary, arteriole and venule blood.',MC)
